&lt;li&gt;PhD in Science, Math, Engineering or other quantitative field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding quantitative problem‐solving skills and mathematical aptitude.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Programming experience &lt;span class=&quot; WPD1 &quot;&gt;is required &lt;/span&gt;(Python, SQL, Java or C++ are a plus).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to communicate information precisely and with agility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A physicalizer; a person who identifies issues and creates solutions without rigid direction or fanfare.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly motivated and tenacious individual, with a proven ability to take initiative and work independently and within a team.&lt;/li&gt;
