&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Position Overview:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research and implement strategies within the firm’s automated trading framework.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze large data sets using advanced statistical methods to identify trading opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop a strong understanding of market structure of various exchanges and asset classes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Typical Day of Quant Researcher:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Primary focus throughout the day is on researching and implementing trading ideas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Before market open, check that all required data and related processes are ready for the trading day.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;During market hours, sporadically monitor behavior and performance of strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
