&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;About Akuna:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Akuna Capital is an innovative trading firm with a strong focus on collaboration, cutting-edge technology, data driven solutions, and automation. We specialize in providing liquidity as an options market maker – meaning we are committed to providing competitive quotes that we are willing to both buy and sell. To do this successfully, we design and implement our own low latency technologies, trading strategies, and mathematical models.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:300,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:350}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Our Founding Partners&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;first conceptualized Akuna in their hometown of Sydney. They opened the firm’s first office in 2011 in the heart of the derivatives industry and the options capital of the world – Chicago. Today, Akuna is proud to operate from additional offices in Sydney, Shanghai, London, and Singapore.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:300,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:350}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
