&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1lil2rx&quot; data-start=&quot;1691&quot; data-end=&quot;1816&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Passionate about understanding volatility dynamics and willing to act quickly on your views to capture market opportunities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
