&lt;p&gt;We are currently hiring a &lt;strong&gt;Data Analyst&lt;/strong&gt; to join our Event Analysis and Insight team. Candidates must have a passion for data manipulation and visualization and the ability to think both independently and collaboratively. They will work on the analysis of post event data, reports and providing insight.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Candidates must be comfortable working within a fast-paced, and at times highly demanding environment. They must possess a keen sense of enthusiasm and attention to detail, as well as a sense of commitment and dedication to both teams.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll feel right at home if you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have at least 1 year of relevant experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have exceptional attention to detail and data gathering skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are great at finding patterns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are great at presenting findings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Love digging through data in search of clues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong desire to leverage the use of AI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are able to balance several time sensitive requests&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have effective communication skills (oral and written)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are extremely organized&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are willing to learn and adapt to a quickly-changing environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have completed a Bachelor’s degree in a related field - economics, finance, commerce, Information Technology or computer science&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a good knowledge of Python for data manipulation and visualization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrive in environments where multitasking is routine and can prioritize tasks effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrive in a fast-paced working environment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work off hours when necessary&lt;/li&gt;
