&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be working on:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyzing non-financial post event data in order to gain insight and discover potential issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creating reports and visualizations to help bring forward relevant information to the stake holders.&lt;/li&gt;
