&lt;p&gt;Optiver is a seeking a Machine Learning Research Engineer to join our team, focusing on a pivotal AI initiative.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;This role would offer the opportunity to have significant impact across Machine Learning infrastructure, training, and inference challenges to advance our futures trading strategies.&lt;/p&gt;
