&lt;li&gt;Have the ability to think creatively about potential misuses of technology and develop innovative solutions to mitigate risks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have shown strong program management skills with the ability to drive policy development processes from ideation to implementation&lt;/li&gt;
