&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the position&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our goal is to give you a real sense of what it&#39;s like to work at Jane Street full time while also providing a truly unparalleled educational experience. As an intern, you&#39;ll be paired with full-time employees who act as mentors, collaborating with you on real-world projects we actually need done.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an SP Intern, you&#39;ll work on projects that combine big-picture thinking with rigorous analytical problem-solving. You&#39;ll learn to break down complex challenges into actionable steps, use data to inform decisions, and build frameworks to tackle business questions. This hands-on experience will give you direct insight into how SPs lead strategic initiatives across the organization and leave you with a strong grasp of what an SP career looks like.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you&#39;d like to learn more, you can explore our Strategy and Product&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.janestreet.com/join-jane-street/sp/&quot;&gt;program&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.janestreet.com/join-jane-street/sp/interviewing&quot;&gt;interview process&lt;/a&gt;. You can also learn more about Jane Street&#39;s internship program &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.janestreet.com/join-jane-street/internships/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you&#39;ve never thought about a career in finance, you&#39;re in good company. Many of us were in the same position before working here. If you have a curious mind, a collaborative nature, and a passion for solving interesting problems, we have a feeling you&#39;ll fit right in. We&#39;re more interested in how you think and learn than what you currently know. You should be:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Someone who excels at taking a structured and careful approach to solving problems, communicates effectively, can drive projects forward, and has exceptional attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excited to learn about a wide range of disciplines and subject matter, including global market dynamics, technical systems and tooling, operational infrastructure, and more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eager to ask questions, admit mistakes, and constantly deepen your understanding&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Currently pursuing a Bachelor&#39;s degree, an MBA, or another advanced degree&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Available to start working full-time in September 2028&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We review applications on a rolling basis and treat all applications equally, regardless of when you apply. While we plan on staying open through the fall, we encourage you to apply by October 31st&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;to help you plan around any other recruiting processes you&#39;re going through.&lt;/p&gt;

